        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yafukula Abahandiichi nabaFarisayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yesu yaboolela abemikanda halala nende abeechibe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ari Abahandiichi nende abaFarisayo beekhalanga khushifumbi shiaMusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila, amakhuwa kosi aka bamubiila, mukakhole nimukalinda; nebutswa muralonda ebikhole biabwe okhubikhola ta; shichila baboolanga, ne shibakhola ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitoto, babohanga emisiiko emisiro, nibachira khumabeka kabandu; ne abeene shibateema okhuchisitiakhwo kata nende olwala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ebikhole biabwe biosi babikholanga mbu balolwe nabandu; okhuba babambusinjia tsiriisi tsiabwe, nibakaliyinjia amayebeyo akokhubiifwalo biabwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibaheela obwikhalo obukhulundu mumasabo, nebifumbi ebiambeli mutsisinagogi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nokhushiesibwa muluyia, nokhulangungwa nende abandu mbu Rabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne inywe muleshenje okhulangwa mbu Rabi; Okhuba omwechesia weenywe nimulala, nineenywe mwesi muli abeebule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi muralanganga omundu yesi mbu seenywe mushialo ta; shichila Seenywe nimulala, ouli mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata muralangungwa mbu abeebaali tawe; shichila omwibaali weenywe nimulala, niye Kristo omwenoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ouli omukhongo mwinywe alaba omukhalabani weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi omundu yesi owiyemekha omwene alatiitiyibwa nowitiitiyia omwene aleemekhwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, inywe abahandiichi nende abaFarisayo, abeekaatii! Shichila mwikalilanga abandu obwami bwomwikulu; okhuba inywe shi mwinjilanga abeene ta, kata abeenabo abeenjilanga shimubafuchiilila okhwiniilamwo tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, inywe abahandiichi nende abaFarisayo, abeekaatii! Shichila muliitsanga tsinzu tsiabakhasi abalekhwa, olwa musabanga nimuboola amakhuwa amarambi khulwa obwikaati; ko akachila eshiina shilimufwila eshikhongo.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, inywe abahandiichi nende abaFarisayo, abeekaatii! Shichila mulambuulanga inyanza nende eshialo khulwa okhukalukhasia omundu mulala; ne olwa aba niyeekalukhasiye ario, mumukholanga abe omwana waGehena okhushila inywe khandi khabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, inywe abeemilisi ababofu, ababooIanga mbu Omundu yesi niyeetsuba khuhekalu, eshiitsuboshie nibutswa; ne omundu yesi niyeetsuba khutsahaabu yeihekalu, kho aba yeeboyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasilu inywe, khandi ababofu; mbu eshishila nishiina, itsahaabu yene, nohomba ihekalu eyichila itsahaabu yiba indakatifu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi, mbu Omundu yesi niyeetsuba khushimalilo shiemisango, eshiitsuboshie nibutswa; ne omundu yesi niyeetsuba khushihaanwa eshili khushio, kho aba yeeboyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababofu inywe; mbu eshishila nishiina, eshihaanwa shiene, nohomba eshimalilo shiemisango eshichila eshihaanwa shiba eshitakatifu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho owitsuba khushimalilo shiemisango, yeetsubanga khushio khandi khubiosi ebilikhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oyo owitsuba khuhekalu yeetsubanga khuyo khandi khumwenoyo oumenyangamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nowitsuba khwikulu, yeetsubanga khushifumbi shiaNyasaye, khandi khumwenoyo owikhalanga khushio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, inywe abahandiichi nende abaFarisayo, abeekaatii! Shichiia mwahulanga eshitonye shielikhumi shiakhuminanaa, nende khubinzari, nende khuchiira, nimuchweya okhuusia amakhuwa amakhongo akomumalako, mbu obukhalachi bwatoto, nende tsimbabasi, nende obwisiikwa, niko aka mwali nimukhoyeele okhukhola, oburalekha okhukhola akeene kalia ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeemilisi ababofu inywe, abeelulangamwo isuna, nimumila mgamia!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, inywe abahandiichi nende abaFarisayo, abeekaatii! Shichila mulabinjia eshikombe nende eshikaye emukongo wabio, ne mukari bibeetsanga biitsuulemwo obunuuli nende obureelinda ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe omuFarisayo omubofu, ranjilila olabie eshikombe nende eshikaye mukari wabio, mbu mana emukongo wabio bilabe birio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
